{"3869290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Evil Cartridge", "steam_appid": 3869290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality can no longer be trusted. Control Greg and escape a serial killer in this retro survival horror with PSX-era graphics, inspired by 80s and 90s films and games. Explore disturbing environments, uncover hidden secrets, and relive the classic third-person cinematic camera. Discover what the distorted reality will reveal: freedom or vengeance. The truth comes at a cost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>Retro Survival Horror<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869290/extras/db473fa77df12b2ca074a9fff30938ed.poster.avif?t=1784131909\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869290/extras/db473fa77df12b2ca074a9fff30938ed.webm?t=1784131909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869290/extras/db473fa77df12b2ca074a9fff30938ed.mp4?t=1784131909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues and uncover why that environment is becoming increasingly unreal. Is reality distorting… or simply revealing the truth? <br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run or Die<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869290/extras/d16a29579502ba552e1e5f74da10491e.poster.avif?t=1784131909\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869290/extras/d16a29579502ba552e1e5f74da10491e.webm?t=1784131909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869290/extras/d16a29579502ba552e1e5f74da10491e.mp4?t=1784131909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A condemned soul will not rest until it drags sinners into the same darkness that consumed it. Flee… or fight to the death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the city in alternate reality, watch out for the hunter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be stealthy, hide inside closets, bathroom stalls, and other places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix some locations on the map with glitches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person camera with tank control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfect blend of tranquil atmosphere and sound effects, guaranteed tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover parts of a larger plot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality can no longer be trusted. Control Greg and escape a serial killer in this retro survival horror with PSX-era graphics, inspired by 80s and 90s films and games. Explore disturbing environments, uncover hidden secrets, and relive the classic third-person cinematic camera. Discover what the distorted reality will reveal: freedom or vengeance. The truth comes at a cost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>Retro Survival Horror<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869290/extras/db473fa77df12b2ca074a9fff30938ed.poster.avif?t=1784131909\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869290/extras/db473fa77df12b2ca074a9fff30938ed.webm?t=1784131909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869290/extras/db473fa77df12b2ca074a9fff30938ed.mp4?t=1784131909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues and uncover why that environment is becoming increasingly unreal. Is reality distorting… or simply revealing the truth? <br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run or Die<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869290/extras/d16a29579502ba552e1e5f74da10491e.poster.avif?t=1784131909\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869290/extras/d16a29579502ba552e1e5f74da10491e.webm?t=1784131909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869290/extras/d16a29579502ba552e1e5f74da10491e.mp4?t=1784131909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A condemned soul will not rest until it drags sinners into the same darkness that consumed it. Flee… or fight to the death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the city in alternate reality, watch out for the hunter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be stealthy, hide inside closets, bathroom stalls, and other places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix some locations on the map with glitches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person camera with tank control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfect blend of tranquil atmosphere and sound effects, guaranteed tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover parts of a larger plot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "After finding a cursed cartridge, explore a distorted reality in